## Architecture Constraints

| Constraint | Rule |
|---|---|
| **File count** | Exactly 3 files touched. No new utility libraries, no new npm packages. |
| **Dependencies** | Use only what already exists in `package.json`. No `sharp`, no `multer`, no `formidable`. Use native canvas resizing on the client and native `fs` on the server. |
| **UI regression** | Zero. The About page must render identically before and after the change. No class changes, no wrapper changes, no animation changes. |
| **Security** | Admin-only upload. Server-side file type + size validation. No arbitrary filenames. Single fixed output path. |
| **Performance** | Client-side compression before upload. Single-file overwrite (no bloat). ISR revalidation (no full page rebuild). |
| **Error handling** | Graceful fallback on About page if DB fails. Clear error messages on admin upload. No unhandled promise rejections. |

